{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id643745089"}, "name":{"label":"vette6"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-18T16:23:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14683444113"}, "title":{"label":"Not reliable"}, "content":{"label":"If you are on a tight work schedule, content creating; this is not the app for you. Definitely can not depend on it for deadlines, repetitive mistakes, regenerates edits, lags for hours at a time sometimes 3-4 hours for a simple edit then puts you on what I call a time out because of regenerating limitations for its own mistakes. Horrible they have to do better.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1567704952"}, "name":{"label":"Ellen Urrutia"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-18T16:16:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2026.279"}, "id":{"label":"14683426733"}, "title":{"label":"ADD VIDEO GENERATION TO CHATGPT"}, "content":{"label":"⭐ 1 STAR — PLEASE LET CHATGPT CREATE ACTUAL VIDEOS!\n\nI am genuinely frustrated with ChatGPT. There are so many updates, but I still can’t ask ChatGPT to create a complete video exactly how I describe it.\n\nI have an entire fictional TV show called The Ackers Empire, with dozens of characters, detailed appearances, ages, and family relationships. I want to describe my show and have ChatGPT generate a beautiful, cinematic TV intro. Instead, I have to search for other AI apps, and so many of them either can’t do what I need or don’t follow my instructions.\n\nPLEASE, OPENAI, MAKE VIDEO GENERATION A FEATURE INSIDE CHATGPT!\n\nI want to type what I imagine, explain my characters, choose the style, and have ChatGPT generate the actual moving video. I don’t just want a script, a storyboard, a picture, or a prompt to paste into another app. I want the finished video!\n\nIt would be amazing if ChatGPT could generate scenes, maintain consistent characters throughout a video, create transitions, and let users revise the results by simply describing what they want changed.\n\nI understand that video generation requires technology and computing resources, but this is a feature that would make ChatGPT so much more useful for creative people. Please consider adding it in a future update and making it accessible to more users.\n\nI LOVE THE IDEA OF BEING ABLE TO CREATE ANYTHING WITH AI, BUT I WANT CHATGPT TO HELP ME BRING MY ACTUAL IDEAS TO LIFE—not constantly send me somewhere else. PLEASE LISTEN TO YOUR USERS! 🎬", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6448311069&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
